# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

A Drogular application generated with Drogular {{DROGULAR_VERSION}}.

## Build

```bash
cmake -S . -B build
cmake --build build
```

## Run

```bash
./build/{{PROJECT_NAME}}
```

Then open http://localhost:8080/.

## Next Steps

- Edit `templates/home.html` to change the page layout.
- Add reusable UI under `src/components/` and `templates/components/`.
- Add another `TemplatePage` and register its route in `src/main.cpp`.
- Put static assets in `public/`; they are served under `/assets`.

Tip: keep pages focused on routing and composition, and move reusable UI into Components.
